  "text": "### 10. External Audit Coordination  \n**Coordination with External Auditors:**\n- Quarterly meetings to align audit plans\n- No duplication of effort\n- Share findings and recommendations\n- Internal audit findings inform external audit risk assessment\n- Joint discussions of significant issues  \n**Regulatory Audit Coordination:**\n- FCA/PRA may conduct examinations\n- Internal Audit provides cooperation and documentation\n- Internal Audit findings shared with regulators (if requested)\n- Board Audit Committee informed of regulatory feedback  \n---",
